# Welcome to harvest-log

A tiny kitchen-garden API, turned into a clearing you can walk. Every arch is
a file; every fountain is a folder.

- The API starts at [[src/index.ts|the entry point]] — its sign says more: [[src/tour.seyn|read the tour]]
- Plain notes live in [[docs/|the docs grove]]
- The world was built by [[https://github.com/SebastianFrazier26/cabn|cabn]]

Signs like this one are *.seyn* files the owner writes next to the code.
